ident; @code{count} is the counter ident.
@end defun

@defun spousesPNode (PNode* pexpr, String svar, String fvar, String count, PNode* body) @arrow{} PNode*
Create a spouse loop PNode that loops through the spouses of a person.  @code{svar} is
