@end defun

@defun childrenPNode (PNode* fexpr, String cvar, String nvar, PNode* body) @arrow{} PNode*
Creates a children loop PNode that loops through the chidren of a
family.  Called by yyparse() on rule reduction; @code{fexpr} is the
family expression; @code{cvar} is the child loop var; @code{nvar} is
the counter; @code{body} is the root PNode of the loop body.
@end defun

@defun forindiPNode (String ivar, String nvar, PNode* body) @arrow{} PNode*
Create a forindi PNode loop to iterate every person in a
