person identifier; @code{nvar} is the counter identifier; and
@code{body} is the PNode loop body.
@end defun

@defun forfamPNode (String fvar, String nvar, PNode* body) @arrow{} PNode*
Creates a forfam PNode loop to iterate every family in a
database.  Called by yyparse on rule reduction; @code{fvar} is the
family identifier; @code{nvar} is the counter identifier, and
@code{body} is the PNode loop body.
@end defun

@defun forsourPNode (String svar, String nvar, PNode* body) @arrow{} PNode*
Creates a forsour PNode loop that iterates every source in a database.
@code{svar} is the family identifier; @code{nvar} is the counter
