@end defun

@defun forothrPNode (String ovar, String nvar, PNode* body) @arrow{} PNode*
Creates a forothr PNode loop that iterates every other record in a database.
@code{ovar} is the family identifier; @code{nvar} is the counter
identifier, and @code{body} is the PNode loop body.
@end defun

@defun forlistPNode (PNode*, String, String, PNode*) @arrow{} PNode*
